  "content": "<p>本模组为Macaw's Mods与Regions Unexplored添加了兼容性。你是否曾梦想建造一座红杉木桥梁？现在，借助这个模组，梦想成真了！</p>\n<p>生物蘑菇系列：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/382/2026-01-14_22.png\"></p>\n<p>木兰系列：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/383/2026-01-14_22.png\"></p>\n<p>淡紫色系列：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/384/2026-01-14_23.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>必需依赖：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可选依赖：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></strong></p>",
